WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.650
Start the day with a little light.

00:04.650 --> 00:09.300
Make a breakfast you love.

00:09.300 --> 00:13.950
Step outside. Find a little surprise.

00:13.950 --> 00:18.600
Slow down with your favorite people.

00:18.600 --> 00:23.600
The day ends. The story stays.
